WEBVTT

00:00:04.060 --> 00:00:06.400
You dirty vampires!

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:14.950
Amazing. They really are
trying to take over the world.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.120
Enough of your screwin' around!

00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:26.880
It's high time you were punished!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:42.100
Out of my way!

00:00:43.100 --> 00:00:44.230
Ritsuka!

00:02:20.160 --> 00:02:25.160
"Opera Ball of Endings and Beginnings"

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:29.540
No! Let me go! Ow!

00:02:39.050 --> 00:02:40.220
Lord Nesta!

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.970
You brat!

00:02:43.430 --> 00:02:45.220
Cease this insolence!

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.470
No!

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:52.650
Lord Nesta, the moon.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:54.480
Prepare for the rite.

00:03:05.530 --> 00:03:07.830
No! Let me go!

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:14.630
May the dazzling ecstasy intoxicate you.

00:03:16.840 --> 00:03:19.260
No!

00:03:23.640 --> 00:03:28.520
All according to my master's will.

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:31.440
Filthy mongrel!

00:03:33.190 --> 00:03:34.520
Wait!

00:03:43.410 --> 00:03:46.080
Ritsuka, it's okay.

00:03:46.080 --> 00:03:47.410
Lindo!

00:03:49.910 --> 00:03:54.330
Stay out of this! That's Lord Nesta's property!

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:56.380
I won't let you touch her!

00:03:56.380 --> 00:04:01.090
Who, you? Some mish-mash dhampir?

00:04:01.090 --> 00:04:02.220
Take care of her.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:03.300
Uh-huh.

00:04:10.810 --> 00:04:12.060
I...

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.770
Don't do anything dangerous.

00:04:17.650 --> 00:04:19.150
Thank goodness...

00:04:21.570 --> 00:04:22.650
Rem?

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:29.240
When this is all over,
there's something I want to tell you.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:33.080
I <i>will</i> protect you!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:38.210
By the sacred Name, obey me.

00:04:38.210 --> 00:04:41.170
O ye who lurk in darkness, begone from here!

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:47.050
Keep those pitiful claws off me!

00:04:48.850 --> 00:04:50.640
You ingrate!

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:55.350
You'd defy Lord Nesta, the father
who so graciously shared his blood?

00:04:56.350 --> 00:04:58.310
I have no father!

00:04:58.310 --> 00:05:03.490
You fool! You'll be throwing yourself
at Lord Nesta's feet before long!

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:07.660
No one can resist his charms.

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:12.410
So just stop. Stop your silly battle.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:14.330
Now who's the fool?

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:18.630
I'll never forgive anyone who'd harm Ritsuka!

00:05:18.630 --> 00:05:24.340
Just how stupid are you?
A dhampir's a dhampir, after all!

00:05:29.470 --> 00:05:31.180
Die!

00:05:39.940 --> 00:05:41.520
Dammit...

00:05:41.520 --> 00:05:43.480
Where'd that come from?!

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:49.570
Begone from here forevermore!

00:06:03.300 --> 00:06:07.420
Lord... Nesta...

00:06:10.090 --> 00:06:12.470
My all...

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.730
Such incompetence.

00:06:35.910 --> 00:06:41.250
My son--My beloved son...

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:43.500
<i>Now</i> you try that? Give me a br--

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:49.970
Do you have any idea
how I've longed to see you?

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:53.260
How deeply I've cared for you?

00:06:53.260 --> 00:06:55.560
No... you wouldn't.

00:06:58.850 --> 00:07:06.530
That was true love.
The beautiful, gentle human girl... Marta.

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:14.030
Poor Marta, whose kindness
caused her heartbreak.

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:17.580
And you, the young son who adored her.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:23.790
I wanted to live with you both--
All three of us, a loving family.

00:07:23.790 --> 00:07:27.590
All three... a loving family...

00:07:27.590 --> 00:07:31.970
Yes... and I desire the forbidden grimoire

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:35.930
in order to make that dream a reality.

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:38.970
We couldn't live together as a family

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:43.150
with those devils ruling the dark realm.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:49.940
If I can obtain the grimoire,
the devils will be destroyed--

00:07:49.940 --> 00:07:52.240
And Marta will be revived!

00:07:54.620 --> 00:07:55.990
Now...

00:07:55.990 --> 00:07:59.200
Come, my beloved son!

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:02.750
Son...

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.460
Lindo!

00:08:11.470 --> 00:08:17.810
My one and only son, blood of my blood!

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:19.600
No, Lindo! He's lying!

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:21.180
Don't listen to him!

00:08:23.140 --> 00:08:29.610
Fight alongside your father.
You hate the devils, too, don't you?

00:08:34.570 --> 00:08:37.160
Come, my son!

00:08:47.210 --> 00:08:49.880
Come, my son!

00:09:12.320 --> 00:09:16.490
I never had a father! <i>Never</i>!

00:09:42.470 --> 00:09:44.220
Mom...

00:09:53.940 --> 00:09:55.150
Lindo!

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.200
Ritsuka!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:04.750
So the exorcist wound up
stealing our moment to shine.

00:10:04.750 --> 00:10:06.500
Ah, once in a while won't hurt.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:09.540
It gave me chills!

00:10:12.460 --> 00:10:14.550
What is it, Rem?

00:10:18.180 --> 00:10:20.930
A mere dhampir

00:10:21.930 --> 00:10:26.640
could never hope to kill the likes of me...

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.150
But how?

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:43.830
Pierce the vampire king's heart
and he'll die writhing in agony.

00:10:43.830 --> 00:10:45.200
He's hidden it.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.450
His heart?

00:10:46.450 --> 00:10:49.870
They may be good-for-nothing bloodsuckers,

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:54.590
but they say their long-lived progenitors
possessed a certain special ability.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:56.510
Where is it?!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:11:01.220
As if the likes of you could ever find it!

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.530
Ritsuka!

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.320
Rem?

00:11:24.910 --> 00:11:26.700
It's no use.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:31.580
The forbidden grimoire is mine! Yes--

00:11:31.580 --> 00:11:36.000
Along with this world and everything in it!

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:43.800
What a pity that you should lose your lives

00:11:43.800 --> 00:11:47.180
before laying eyes on my kingdom!

00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:51.940
Grimoire... Grimoire...

00:11:53.440 --> 00:11:55.190
Grimoire!

00:11:59.320 --> 00:12:03.160
Everything changed because of that grimoire.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:11.830
All because of the grimoire
sleeping inside me... The grimoire...

00:12:13.000 --> 00:12:16.590
No. No, I'm sick of it!

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:23.220
Sick of people hurting others...
and people getting hurt...

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:28.760
Sick of going along with my
cruel destiny instead of defying it...

00:12:28.760 --> 00:12:35.900
That does it: I'm going
to choose my own destiny!

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:55.710
Ritsuka?

00:12:57.880 --> 00:13:02.550
And I... I'll protect them all!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.320
Azuna...

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:19.710
A vampire who goes on surviving in darkness,

00:14:19.710 --> 00:14:23.880
unable to face death as a human...

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:27.670
That's enough. It's over.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:33.600
Go back to being human... and sleep.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.430
Sleep in peace.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:24.400
Ritsuka!

00:15:26.570 --> 00:15:30.200
Ritsuka? Ritsuka? Ritsuka!

00:15:34.030 --> 00:15:36.160
Rem...

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:40.580
I don't ever want to let you go again.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:49.510
I've never seen him like this.

00:15:49.510 --> 00:15:50.220
Hmph.

00:15:50.220 --> 00:15:54.220
Aw, the grimoire's disappeared.

00:15:55.350 --> 00:15:58.390
So has its scent, almost.

00:15:58.390 --> 00:16:01.640
We've got time.

00:16:01.640 --> 00:16:05.810
We just need to wait another 615 years.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:10.190
And for my master, Lord Maksis...

00:16:10.190 --> 00:16:13.780
I'll have to search for
something else, I suppose.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:23.960
Our fate may have been sealed
from the moment we met.

00:16:23.960 --> 00:16:27.920
The stirring in my heart every time we met...

00:16:27.920 --> 00:16:31.010
I didn't even know what to call it.

00:16:32.590 --> 00:16:33.880
But...

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.810
Now to tell you what I said I would:

00:16:42.270 --> 00:16:45.150
I love you.

00:16:50.530 --> 00:16:54.240
I... I love you, too.

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:20.970
With the grimoire gone, I have
no reason to remain in this world.

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:22.770
Come with me.

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:26.140
Live with me.

00:17:27.150 --> 00:17:32.190
It's no pipe dream--
Not when you have devil blood.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:41.530
♪ Dance with destinies ♪

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:47.170
♪ The sky's aglitter with millions of stars ♪

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:56.170
♪ Our chance meeting: that's the miracle ♪

00:17:56.170 --> 00:18:01.600
♪ I'll tell you the feelings overflowing my heart ♪

00:18:01.600 --> 00:18:09.440
♪ I love you forever and ever ♪

00:18:15.490 --> 00:18:25.370
♪ She's found her own wings ♪

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:35.300
♪ I'll go on protecting her, watching from afar ♪

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:39.800
I promise. That's how I show my love.

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:45.810
♪ Dance in a sweet dream ♪

00:18:45.810 --> 00:18:51.350
♪ We can go together, hand in hand ♪

00:18:51.350 --> 00:19:00.610
♪ To that place that we've seen in our dreams ♪

00:19:00.610 --> 00:19:05.910
♪ Exchanging with one another our eternal vows ♪

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:13.710
♪ I love you forever and ever ♪

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:22.510
I'll make you happy--This I promise.

00:19:25.600 --> 00:19:30.690
♪ You must choose now ♪

00:19:30.690 --> 00:19:35.650
♪ Two worlds, two paths--Human? Or devil? ♪

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:40.570
♪ Human? Or devil? ♪

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:44.120
♪ Two worlds, two paths ♪

00:19:50.870 --> 00:19:55.540
♪ Dance with destinies ♪

00:19:55.540 --> 00:20:01.550
♪ I don't want to part from the one I love ♪

00:20:01.550 --> 00:20:11.560
♪ The world we walk in together--His world ♪

00:20:11.560 --> 00:20:17.230
♪ I don't want to lose those dear to me ♪

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:25.950
♪ The world we've lived in--My world ♪

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:32.410
Which do I choose?

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:42.420
♪ I'll decide my own destiny ♪

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:55.560
♪ The path that lets me be my true self ♪

00:21:10.120 --> 00:21:14.540
I choose... to live as a human.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:18.540
See you later, my beautiful butterfly.

00:21:18.540 --> 00:21:22.210
The next time we meet, you'll be mine!

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:26.800
You poor thing. You and I, we'll fall together.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:31.640
Let us meet again, if fate allows.

00:21:35.350 --> 00:21:39.520
♪ Dance with my devil ♪

00:21:39.520 --> 00:21:45.900
♪ My one and only love--
My dear, dear, dear devil ♪

00:21:45.900 --> 00:21:55.830
♪ Now we'll part to walk two paths ♪

00:21:55.830 --> 00:22:01.420
♪ We'll meet again in the far distant future ♪

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:09.890
♪ I'll love you forever and ever ♪

00:22:17.640 --> 00:22:22.440
Goodbye... my dearest devil.

00:23:19.500 --> 00:23:23.880
Welcome back, Lord Maksis.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:29.470
<i>It's a secret you can't tell anyone</i>

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:40.100
<i>Wonth gir sliv edhti wecnad</i>

00:23:40.100 --> 00:23:41.560
<i>Wonth gir</i>

00:23:43.690 --> 00:23:47.190
<i>Cracking a smile only at the witching hour</i>

00:23:47.190 --> 00:23:50.150
<i>Spreading rumors sotto voce</i>

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:52.660
<i>You knocked on the door</i>

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:56.200
<i>Without looking behind you</i>

00:23:56.200 --> 00:23:59.870
<i>With all these mysteries, impossible to solve</i>

00:23:59.870 --> 00:24:02.790
<i>You stopped cold, weak in the knees</i>

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:05.290
<i>It hacks everything</i>

00:24:05.290 --> 00:24:07.590
<i>The curse of love</i>

00:24:07.590 --> 00:24:09.840
<i>The curse--and you</i>

00:24:09.840 --> 00:24:14.260
<i>If you're confused about the touch on your skin</i>

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:17.890
<i>We just can't be transparent</i>

00:24:17.890 --> 00:24:21.730
<i>Soon (soon)</i>

00:24:21.730 --> 00:24:24.440
<i>Won't you take this hand?</i>

00:24:24.440 --> 00:24:32.150
<i>Mademoiselle, mademoiselle:
I'll make you happy</i>

00:24:32.150 --> 00:24:35.950
<i>This night will never come again</i>

00:24:35.950 --> 00:24:38.830
<i>So let us swear to one another</i>

00:24:38.830 --> 00:24:46.130
<i>The black clown singing of love
at the tip of the moon</i>

00:24:46.130 --> 00:24:47.920
<i>Obscuring the sky</i>

00:24:47.920 --> 00:24:52.880
<i>Casting a spell with a bewitching fever</i>
